%%report medical-record-per-encounter title: MEDICAL_RECORDs per encounter entity: MEDICAL_RECORD chart: bar x: encounter y: records help: Operational Medical Record record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Which encounter the most medical_records belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.encounter_number::text, '(none)') AS encounter, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_medical_record x LEFT JOIN bus_encounter p ON p.id = x.encounter_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
