%%report clinical-order-lifecycle title: CLINICAL_ORDER lifecycle entity: CLINICAL_ORDER chart: bar x: state y: records help: Operational Clinical Order record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Where clinical_orders sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'ORDERED' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'ACCEPTED', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'SCHEDULED', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'IN_PROGRESS', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'COMPLETED', 4 UNION ALL SELECT 'RESULTED', 5 UNION ALL SELECT 'CANCELLED', 6 UNION ALL SELECT 'REJECTED', 7) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_clinical_order WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
