%%report prescription-item-duration-days-per-month title: Average duration days per month (PRESCRIPTION_ITEM) entity: PRESCRIPTION_ITEM chart: line x: month y: average_duration_days help: Operational Prescription Item record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. The average duration days of prescription_items created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(duration_days)::numeric, 2) AS average_duration_days FROM bus_prescription_item WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report dispense-by-status title: DISPENSEs by status entity: DISPENSE chart: bar x: status y: records help: Operational Dispense record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. How dispenses divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dispense WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report dispense-lifecycle title: DISPENSE lifecycle entity: DISPENSE chart: bar x: state y: records help: Operational Dispense record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Where dispenses sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'REQUESTED' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'VERIFIED', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'IN_PREPARATION', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'READY', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'DISPENSED', 4 UNION ALL SELECT 'REJECTED', 5 UNION ALL SELECT 'CANCELLED', 6) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dispense WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
