%%report goods-receipt-by-status title: GOODS_RECEIPTs by status entity: GOODS_RECEIPT chart: pie x: status y: records help: Operational Goods Receipt record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. How goods_receipts divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_goods_receipt WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report goods-receipt-lifecycle title: GOODS_RECEIPT lifecycle entity: GOODS_RECEIPT chart: bar x: state y: records help: Operational Goods Receipt record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Where goods_receipts sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'DRAFT' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'INSPECTING', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'ACCEPTED', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'PARTIALLY_ACCEPTED', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'REJECTED', 4 UNION ALL SELECT 'POSTED', 5) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_goods_receipt WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
