%%report payment-lifecycle title: PAYMENT lifecycle entity: PAYMENT chart: bar x: state y: records help: Operational Payment record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Where payments sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'PENDING' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'AUTHORIZED', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'SETTLED', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'FAILED', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'REVERSED', 4) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_payment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
