%%report fiscal-period-lifecycle title: FISCAL_PERIOD lifecycle entity: FISCAL_PERIOD chart: bar x: state y: records help: Operational Fiscal Period record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Where fiscal_periods sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'OPEN' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'CLOSING', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'CLOSED', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'LOCKED', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_fiscal_period WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
