%%report bank-transaction-largest-by-amount title: The ten largest bank_transactions by amount entity: BANK_TRANSACTION chart: bar x: record y: amount help: Operational Bank Transaction record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. The records with the highest amount; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT transaction_reference::text AS record, amount FROM bus_bank_transaction WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND amount IS NOT NULL ORDER BY amount DESC LIMIT 10
%%report bank-transaction-per-bank-transaction title: BANK_TRANSACTIONs per bank transaction entity: BANK_TRANSACTION chart: bar x: bank_transaction y: records help: Operational Bank Transaction record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. Which bank transaction the most bank_transactions belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.transaction_reference::text, '(none)') AS bank_transaction, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bank_transaction x LEFT JOIN bus_bank_transaction p ON p.id = x.bank_transaction_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
