%%report bank-reconciliation-by-status title: BANK_RECONCILIATIONs by status entity: BANK_RECONCILIATION chart: pie x: status y: records help: Operational Bank Reconciliation record used by hospital staff from initial capture through accountable completion, preserving the evidence needed for care, administration and audit. How bank_reconciliations divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bank_reconciliation WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
